<section class="section featured" aria-labelledby="glow-lineup-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="glow-lineup-title">What we do best</h2></div>
  <div class="feature-grid">
    <article class="feature-card soap-card">
      <div class="feature-photo soap-feature-photo"><img src="{{ 'rose-soap.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Rosy soap with real flowers"></div>
      <h3>Soaps</h3><p>Creamy bars poured in tiny batches for a fresh, soft-skin reset.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card shimmer-card">
      <div class="feature-photo shimmer-feature-photo"><img src="{{ 'bronze-balm-v2.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Bronze Kiss My Balm shimmer lotion bar"></div>
      <h3>Shimmer Lotion Bars</h3><p>Melty moisture with a soft body-glow finish for shoulders, legs, and collarbones.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card balm-card">
      <div class="feature-photo balm-feature-photo"><img src="{{ 'melon-kiss-lip-gloss.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Melon Kiss lip gloss"></div>
      <h3>Lip Gloss</h3><p>Crystal-packed shimmer with a juicy watermelon flavor, delivering a sheer tint and dazzling gloss that outshines ordinary lip glosses.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

